  "storyId": "main_2_level_main_02-05_beg",
  "groupId": "main_2",
  "stageId": "main_02-05",
  "title": "Falling Objects",
  "storyCode": "2-5",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "63c139b75780066ca82c2151a6fcccaf3e7ad085d68f4eba34101dfad114310a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第十七关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Rhodes Island sure is taking their time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Oh...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "We're almost at the interception point!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Tch, finally... I just finished unpacking.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "What a waste.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Hurry up! Those in the back, follow more closely!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Hey, masked person over there.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Who is it? !",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "What do you want?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "All of you, come at me. I'm short on time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "Amiya, Texas from Penguin Logistics has returned.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Ahh... what a relief!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "I have an update here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "I just took care of some guys who called themselves 'Reunion.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "... But there are a lot more of them coming.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Reunion has come out of hiding and are starting to move in groups.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "It's as I feared...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Reunion has already infiltrated Lungmen through the slums...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "And their target... is the same as ours.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Otherwise, there would be no reason for them to come after Rhodes Island.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "Miss Misha is carrying secrets that only Lungmen and Reunion know.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "We're caught in a disadvantageous situation.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "Things aren't looking good for us right now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "I'll really have to poke that officer's pretty little face later to find out what's actually going on.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "...Anything else to add?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "If not, I'll lead the way. I know exactly where to go!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Exusiai has confirmed our escape route. I'll now take you through it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Franka, gather all the squads. We--",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "We... should find cover first.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "Reunion is already here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Over here! Don't let them get away!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "There's nothing more annoying than when trouble keeps nipping at your tail.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "...Something's wrong.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "No...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "They... have a leader!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "Ugh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Watch out!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Skullshatterer, they're right here. Yes, that's her!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Casters, go! Tear them to shreds!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "They mean business...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "Watch out! The enemy has deployed multiple casters! Prepare appropriate countermeasures!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "What they're after is...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "...Misha!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Aah... Who... are you...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Finally...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "I...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "I've finally... found you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Who are you...?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
